From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hendra Manudinata <manoedinata@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 06:06:58 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 36/97] arm64: dts: exynos: add minimal Exynos7570 and Galaxy
 J4 (j4lte)

Bring-up skeleton: four Cortex-A53 cores on PSCI, GIC, arch timer and a
fixed 26 MHz oscillator. The J4 board file reserves the Samsung firmware
carve-outs, a ramoops region that survives warm resets and describes the
bootloader-provided framebuffer so the boot can be observed without a
UART. No clock controller yet, so boot with clk_ignore_unused.

Document the samsung,j4lte / samsung,exynos7570 compatibles.

Signed-off-by: Hendra Manudinata <manoedinata@gmail.com>
(cherry picked from commit 73afaf579b61bab33f149247ab55e7e43ea3eb48)
---
